00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:49.560
companies in the region. Scaling into a winning trade without first closing the initial position

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:55.000
is a disciplined way to let evidence of momentum guide position size rather than emotion.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.800
Today's market conditions reward this approach because volatility from geopolitical headlines

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:06.360
